+*   **Grid Size:** Matches the sub-image size (with padding) onto which the current chunk projects [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Volume Sample Type:** Four-byte floating-point [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Key Type:** Four-byte integer [S1, unofficial].
